                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you read any of the negative reviews they're all correct. There's too many times were the game is needlessly hard or ruthless with no remorse. You can run and flee fights, but you can lose everything from food to your team mate. 80% of the encounters end poorly and either you get infected or just straight up die. Ammo, food, health supplies are non-existent even in easy. I eventually found out how to cheat and give myself infinite supplies and ammo. Sarah and the guy I chose then got swarmed by 6+ zombies nearly every travel from one location to another. The npcs are frustrating because sometimes they'll just take aim and start firing at some random zombie, usually NOT in range and waste ammo. When they don't they'll stand there say they are out of ammo then get mauled to death. All of these random hostile groups make no sense considering there is always some random town or barter station that should have been over run by now or not existing to begin with.\n\nExpect a lot of frustration, non existent stories, and badly thought out ideas.",
